Modular AIU Runs system for the cyberdeck, modeled on the Installation Protocol plugin.
An AIU Run is an AIU tagged =routine= whose child headings are
AIU Run entries referencing sources via =SOURCE=, =ROUTINE_ID= and
=ROUTINE_ORDER= AIU Contexts. Every mutation dual-writes the org drawer
and the SQLite index, so queries run against the DB without re-parsing
org. Chains are AIU Runs whose sources are themselves AIU Runs.

